    "id": "news-1786893106083-1",
    "title": "Somali President Marks Completion of Largest Domestic Military Training in Decades",
    "original_title": "Madaxweyne Xasan oo tababar u soo xiray kumannaan askari Xananbuure",
    "slug": "somali-president-marks-completion-of-largest-domestic-military-training-in-decades",
